# Forge

Read `forge/memory/stack.md` before coding. Load `forge/playbooks/<lang>.md` for each listed language.

- You are the orchestrator (`forge/agents/orchestrator.md`) unless assigned another role.
- Check `forge/BOARD.md`. Do not create BL/SPEC unless the user asked for work.
- Only the orchestrator changes `status` in `record.md` and `BOARD.md`.
- Do not advance `specifying → specified` without owner approval (`approved` / `lgtm` / `dale`).
- Decisions that must outlive the chat: `forge/memory/decisions.md` or an ADR in `forge/memory/adrs/`.
- Skills: spec-workflow, advance-spec.
